<!-- Commands.md, table of commands: rows (the boss commands are shared by Ultron, Thanos and Apocalypse; whoever stitches keeps one copy) -->
| `/enhanced boss start <ultron\|thanos\|apocalypse> [force]` | Starts a boss fight at your feet, with no ritual item. `force` skips the checks of the ground (not the sky). For Ultron: [Ultron](Ultron). |
| `/enhanced boss stop` | Ends the running boss fight (the island of Sokovia is put back, a used Program is given back). |
| `/enhanced boss list` | Lists the running boss fights. |
| `/enhanced boss cleanup <center> <radius>` | Removes whatever a boss left in the sky or on the ground there (a floating island of Sokovia after a lost note). |

<!-- Commands.md, table "Powers": one row -->
| `ultron` | [Ultron](Ultron) |

<!-- Commands.md, table "Looks": one row -->
| Ultron | `prime`, `sentry`, `human`, `own` |

<!-- Commands.md, table "Examples": rows -->
| `/enhanced boss start ultron` | Wakes Ultron where you stand, with no Program or Scepter. |
| `/enhanced power set Steve ultron sentry` | Makes Steve Ultron, in the Sentry look. |
| `/enhanced boss cleanup ~ ~ ~ 40` | Removes a leftover island of Sokovia within 40 blocks. |

<!-- Commands.md, section "Looking at the animations": a line under /enhanced_anim, or a short section of its own -->
`/enhanced_model <ultron|ultron_sentry|vibranium_key> <state> [tick]` is also a game-only command for the people who draw: it shows a copy of the boss, a Sentry or the Vibranium Key in a state (for Ultron: `idle`, `volley`, `beams`, `dive`, `pull`, `call`, `punch`, `stagger`, `lift`, `transfer`, `death`, `awakening`, `hybrid`, `ultron3`...), frozen at a tick. `/enhanced_model list` shows what can be shown.
